{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34412","headline":"奉和袭美夏景冲澹偶作次韵二首 二 · 陆龟蒙","name":"奉和袭美夏景冲澹偶作次韵二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祗於池曲象山幽，便是潇湘浸石楼。\n斜拂芡盘轻鹜下，细穿菱线小鲵游。\n闲开茗焙尝须徧，醉拨书帷卧始休。\n莫道仙家无好爵，方诸还拜碧琳侯。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆龟蒙","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_34412.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_34412","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}